# The Poffin House in Hearthome, cooking alone.
#
# The player stands one tile south of the cook (5,10) facing her, so the
# script's first spare A press starts the conversation. Berries are what
# CheckCanCookPoffin looks for, an empty Berries pocket sends the script
# straight to "you have no Berry to cook with" and the run never opens the
# application.

name COOKIE
gender GENDER_MALE
trainer-id 20481
money 3000
var VAR_PLAYER_STARTER SPECIES_TURTWIG
party SPECIES_ROSELIA 20 ITEM_NONE
item ITEM_POFFIN_CASE 1
item ITEM_CHERI_BERRY 10
map MAP_HEADER_POFFIN_HOUSE 5 11 FACE_UP
